ARTWORK PROVENANCE
All character, card, and stadium artwork in this project was produced with
generative image tooling (including but not limited to the built-in image
generation tooling used during development, and the PixelLab service). It is not
photographic and does not depict real people. Prompts and provenance notes are
recorded under assets/*/README.md, assets/*/PROMPTS.md and docs/art/.

AI-GENERATED CONTENT DISCLOSURE
Disclosure that this product contains generative-AI-produced artwork is made here
proactively, including for storefronts and distribution platforms that require it.

RESEARCH AND REFERENCE MATERIALS
Development referenced publicly available baseball footage, instructional
material, and reference imagery to study motion and composition. The shipped
artwork was not traced from any photograph, film, or other protected work. See
docs/visual/ for the per-asset notes.

